label story_02_start (An Ill Omen - Begin)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core": They come for my light at night — that has always been true. But now they come with a pattern. Count what the dark sends. I need to know what we are facing before it learns to count us back.
"Dianthus Core": Ten is a threshold. Ten shadows fallen and I will feel the shape of what waits behind them. Fight when the sun goes down. The soil will keep a record.
[end_timeline]
